BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:breakfast-block@longevity-tracker
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20240101T084500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20240101T091500
RRULE:FREQ=DAILY;INTERVAL=1
SUMMARY:🍳 Breakfast & Metabolic Optimization Block (30 min)
DESCRIPTION:Timing: 2:45-3:00 hours after waking\nBreak fast 16-18 hours after last meal (if doing 16:8 intermittent fasting)\n\nHigh-Protein, Nutrient-Dense Breakfast:\n- Target: 30-40g protein, 10-15g fiber, 15-20g healthy fats, 40-60g complex carbs\n\nEssential Morning Supplements:\n- Vitamin D3 (2000 IU)\n- Vitamin C (500 mg)\n- Omega-3 (800 mg EPA/DHA)\n- Turmeric/Curcumin (1g)\n- CoQ10 (100mg)\n- NR/NMN (375mg/500mg)\n- Lion's Mane Mushroom (optional)\n- Spermidine (10mg)\n\nPost-Breakfast Walk (15 min):\n- Enhances glucose disposal, improves insulin sensitivity
LOCATION:Home
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT5M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Breakfast & Metabolic Optimization Block starting in 5 minutes
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT

