BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wind-down@longevity-tracker
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20240101T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20240101T210000
RRULE:FREQ=DAILY;INTERVAL=1
SUMMARY:🌙 Wind-Down Activities Block (30 min)
DESCRIPTION:Digital sunset begins: No screens 2 hours before bed\n- Blue light blocking: Use blue light glasses or screen filters\n- Dim lights: Use warm, dim lighting (candles, salt lamps)\n- Why: Blue light suppresses melatonin, delaying sleep onset\n\nHerbal tea: Chamomile, tulsi (holy basil), or passionflower\n\nLight reading: Physical book (not digital)\n- Why: Physical books don't emit blue light, promote relaxation\n\nJournal & gratitude:\n- Review day, plan tomorrow breakfast/lunch/dinner and tasks\n- 3 things grateful for\n\nGentle stretching or yoga (if not done earlier)
LOCATION:Home
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT5M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Wind-Down Activities Block starting in 5 minutes
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:supplements-sleep@longevity-tracker
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20240101T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20240101T213000
RRULE:FREQ=DAILY;INTERVAL=1
SUMMARY:💊 Supplements & Sleep Prep (30 min)
DESCRIPTION:Evening Supplements:\n- Ashwagandha (600mg) - stress management, cortisol reduction\n- Magnesium (400mg) - muscle recovery, sleep quality, stress reduction\n  Forms: Magnesium glycinate or citrate (best absorption)\n- Optional: L-Theanine (200mg) - if feeling anxious\n\nSleep Environment Optimization:\n- Cool room: 65-68°F (18-20°C)\n- Dark room: Blackout curtains, eye mask\n- Quiet: Earplugs or white noise machine\n- No electronics: Phone in another room or airplane mode\n- Prepare tomorrow's clothes (reduces morning decision fatigue)\n\nFinal Wind-Down:\n- Deep breathing or meditation (5-10 minutes)\n  Type: Box breathing, 4-7-8 breathing, Body scan\n- Final supplements (if needed):\n  Melatonin (300 mcg) - only if sleep issues persist\n\nSleep Timing:\n- Target bedtime: 9:30-10:00 PM (3-4 hours after dinner)\n- Target sleep: 7-9 hours\n- Sleep consistency: Same bedtime/wake time (±30 min) - critical for circadian rhythm
LOCATION:Home
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT5M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Supplements & Sleep Prep starting in 5 minutes
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT

